{"seq":3,"slug":"orm-data-access-patterns","title":"ORM 与数据访问模式","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","categoryLabel":"后端工程","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/orm-data-access-patterns","rating":{"composite":3.6,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# ORM 与数据访问模式 简介\n\n数据访问是几乎每个后端服务的核心，做得好坏直接决定性能与可维护性。本 hub 面向需要在 ORM 与原生 SQL 之间做选择、并避开数据层常见陷阱的后端工程师，覆盖 ORM 与 SQL 的取舍、Active Record 与 Data Mapper 两大流派、仓储模式，查询构建器与对象-关系阻抗失配、延迟/急切加载策略，N+1、连接池、缓存与批量化等性能陷阱，以及事务边界、工作单元与零停机的数据库迁移。贯穿全篇的底线是：始终知道数据库实际在执行什么 SQL。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-access-fundamentals","title":"Data Access Fundamentals","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/orm-data-access-patterns/data-access-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"orm-vs-sql","title":"ORM 与原生 SQL 的取舍","url":"/h/backend-engineering/orm-data-access-patterns/data-access-fundamentals/orm-vs-sql","wordCount":1364,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"active-record-vs-data-mapper","title":"Active Record 与 Data Mapper","url":"/h/backend-engineering/orm-data-access-patterns/data-access-fundamentals/active-record-vs-data-mapper","wordCount":1238,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"repository-pattern","title":"仓储模式","url":"/h/backend-engineering/orm-data-access-patterns/data-access-fundamentals/repository-pattern","wordCount":1352,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章建立数据访问的基础认知：先权衡 ORM 与原生 SQL 的取舍并给出务实混用之道，再对比 Active Record 与 Data Mapper 两大 ORM 流派对领域纯粹度与可测试性的不同取向，最后讲清仓储模式如何用领域语言为数据访问提供一层有意义的抽象及其常见反模式。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"query-and-mapping","title":"Query And Mapping","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/orm-data-access-patterns/query-and-mapping","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"query-builders","title":"查询构建器","url":"/h/backend-engineering/orm-data-access-patterns/query-and-mapping/query-builders","wordCount":1232,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slu